DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2467::$$$message_0015_0000_0000$$$::In the yard of my house, there is a shed and a dojo.[lr]::
2468::$$$message_0015_0000_0001$$$::I'm not sure if they were here before Kiritsugu moved in, or if he built them after he acquired the property.[lr]::
2469::$$$message_0015_0000_0002$$$::In any case, whoever built them had bold taste.::
2470::$$$message_0015_0001_0000$$$::"Dojo aside, that shed... It feels like it was meant to be a brewery or a pawnshop."[lr]::
2471::$$$message_0015_0001_0001$$$::"Brewery? Pawnshop?"[lr]::
2472::$$$message_0015_0001_0002$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
2473::$$$message_0015_0001_0003$$$::I turn to the sudden voice and see Illya looking puzzled.::
2474::$$$message_0015_0002_0000$$$::"A pawnshop is a pfandhaus, right?"[lr]::
2475::$$$message_0015_0002_0001$$$::"Yeah. I've never been to one. I heard there's a well-known one in one of the back alleys of the shopping district, though."[lr]::
2476::$$$message_0015_0002_0002$$$::"I know it. The person at the fish store said that 'little Miss Tohsaka loves going there.'"::
2477::$$$message_0015_0003_0000$$$::"What...?"[lr]::
2478::$$$message_0015_0003_0001$$$::Tohsaka goes to a pawnshop...?[lr]::
2479::$$$message_0015_0003_0002$$$::Don't tell me she's been pinching pennies so hard that she's resorted to pawning off the family jewels...::
2480::$$$message_0015_0004_0000$$$::"No, not like that, Shirou.[lr]::
2481::$$$message_0015_0004_0001$$$::Rin is looking for unclaimed jewels. It goes against custom, but old jewels abandoned by their former owners are more effective in magecraft."::
2482::$$$message_0015_0005_0000$$$::"Hm... Like going to the shrine when the spiritual energy is strongest?"[lr]::
2483::$$$message_0015_0005_0001$$$::"I'll leave it to your imagination. But imagine how strong the jewels of an old madam who died a violent death would be."::
2484::$$$message_0015_0006_0000$$$::...That does sound terrifying.[lr]::
2485::$$$message_0015_0006_0001$$$::But, I see.[lr]::
2486::$$$message_0015_0006_0002$$$::I sometimes wonder where Tohsaka gets all those precious gems from. She even uses pawn shops, huh... I might end up there sometime, too...::
2487::$$$message_0015_0007_0000$$$::"Hey, by the way,[lr]::
2488::$$$message_0015_0007_0001$$$::what's a brewery?"[lr]::
2489::$$$message_0015_0007_0002$$$::"Huh? Oh, the thing you make sake in. A manufacturer of alcohol."[lr]::
2490::$$$message_0015_0007_0003$$$::"Oh, like a weinkellerei or a brennerei. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11c(中) textoff=0]You use rice to make alcohol in this country, right?"::
2491::$$$message_0015_0008_0000$$$::Illya must be talking about nihonshu, or "sake," as it's often called abroad.[lr]::
2492::$$$message_0015_0008_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ05a(中) textoff=0]Rice alcohol... It sounds like pickling rice in shochu, like when you make plum liqueur.::
2493::$$$message_0015_0009_0000$$$::"There's shochu too, not just refined rice wine."[lr]::
2494::$$$message_0015_0009_0001$$$::"Huh... So the shed was meant to be used that way."[lr]::
2495::$$$message_0015_0009_0002$$$::Illya sounds oddly impressed.[lr]::
2496::$$$message_0015_0009_0003$$$::...She does own a castle. Maybe the Einzbern house...::
2497::$$$message_0015_0010_0000$$$::"Hey... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ07a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07a(中) textoff=0]Do you have a wine cellar or a brewery in your castle, Illya?"[lr]::
2498::$$$message_0015_0010_0001$$$::"Huh? Which castle are you talking about?"[lr]::
2499::$$$message_0015_0010_0002$$$::Argh, this is the problem with talking to mega-rich people.::
2500::$$$message_0015_0011_0000$$$::"The castle in Fuyuki is a vacation home. We do have an underground weinkeller, but it isn't used at all."[lr]::
2501::$$$message_0015_0011_0001$$$::"What about the one in your country?"[lr]::
2502::$$$message_0015_0011_0002$$$::"We don't have the climate for winemaking...but we do have a distillery."[lr]::
2503::$$$message_0015_0011_0003$$$::"Huh. You make whisky or something?"::
2504::$$$message_0015_0012_0000$$$::"I think it would be more accurate to call it an eau de vie.[lr]::
2505::$$$message_0015_0012_0001$$$::We supply a lot of magical reagents, and we can never create enough alcohols to satisfy the demand."[lr]::
2506::$$$message_0015_0012_0002$$$::"Huh. So it's a factory for experimental reagents."[lr]::
2507::$$$message_0015_0012_0003$$$::Researchers would need a lot of chemicals to preserve specimens, among other things.::
2508::$$$message_0015_0013_0000$$$::"You don't use your cellar to store any spirits."[lr]::
2509::$$$message_0015_0013_0001$$$::"Even if I made it I don't really drink alcohol. It's just for storage now."[lr]::
2510::$$$message_0015_0013_0002$$$::"Well, it's your workshop... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ05a(中)][wvl][movefg opacity=0 left=368 top=146 time=380 accel=2 storage=イリヤ05a(中) textoff=0][wait canskip=false time=300][move time=230 path=(374,210,255)(307,185,255) accel=2 storage=イリヤ11a(中) spline=1 textoff=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][move time=230 path=(278,222,255)(230,185,255) accel=2 storage=イリヤ11a(中) spline=1 textoff=0][wvl]Right, Big Brother?[wm canskip=0]"::
2511::$$$message_0015_0014_0000$$$::"Ngh..."[lr]::
2512::$$$message_0015_0014_0001$$$::I'm startled by the unexpected change in the way she addresses me.[lr]::
2513::$$$message_0015_0014_0002$$$::And with that smile, too... She could convince me to do anything with that.::
2514::$$$message_0015_0015_0000$$$::"Can I look at your shed?"[lr]::
2515::$$$message_0015_0015_0001$$$::"...Sure. It isn't anything interesting, though."[lr]::
2516::$$$message_0015_0015_0002$$$::"Hehehe. Don't worry about it. I just wanted to take a look at your workshop!"::
2517::$$$message_0015_0016_0000$$$::"Then go ahead. It's a little dusty."[lr]::
2518::$$$message_0015_0016_0001$$$::"Yay! Thanks, Shirou!"[lr]::
2519::$$$message_0015_0016_0002$$$::Her joy is infectious.[lr]::
2520::$$$message_0015_0016_0003$$$::I'm glad to see someone else likes my workshop, no matter how shoddy it is.::
2521::$$$message_0015_0017_0000$$$::"Wow."[lr]::
2522::$$$message_0015_0017_0001$$$::Illya runs inside.[lr]::
2523::$$$message_0015_0017_0002$$$::She stares at the piles of junk.::
2524::$$$message_0015_0018_0000$$$::"Did you collect all this stuff?"[lr]::
2525::$$$message_0015_0018_0001$$$::"Half of it is mine, and half of it is Fuji-nee's. The random stuff is [font italic=true]all[font italic=false] hers. It keeps growing every time I see it."[lr]::
2526::$$$message_0015_0018_0002$$$::"I can totally imagine Taiga having a habit like that, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06e(遠)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ06e(遠) time=300 textoff=0]yeah."::
2527::$$$message_0015_0019_0000$$$::[se storage=se422.wav]Illya starts rifling [se storage=se250.wav]through the junk[se storage=se406.wav].[lr]::
2528::$$$message_0015_0019_0001$$$::[se storage=se359.wav]There's a lot of dust, so [se storage=se286.wav]I'm worried she'll get her clothes dirty.::
2529::$$$message_0015_0020_0000$$$::"Illya, I have gloves if you want to look through them."[lr]::
2530::$$$message_0015_0020_0001$$$::"It's okay... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ10c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ10c(遠) textoff=0 last=イリヤ11d(遠)]Oooh, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ10c(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][movefg opacity=255 left=379 top=202 time=300 accel=3 storage=イリヤ10c(遠) textoff=0]what's this?[wm canskip=0]"::
2531::$$$message_0015_0021_0000$$$::[move time=200 path=(348,240,255)(321,345,255) accel=-2 storage=イリヤ10c(遠) spline=1 textoff=0]With a "heave-[wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=0 left=379 top=202 time=300 accel=3 storage=イリヤ10c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=369 top=172 time=300 accel=4 storage=イリヤ08d(遠) textoff=0]ho," [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]Illya pulls out something round.::
2532::$$$message_0015_0022_0000$$$::"It's a shichirin... Why would Fuji-nee put this here?"[lr]::
2533::$$$message_0015_0022_0001$$$::"A shichirin? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ02a(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ02a(遠) textoff=0]Is that like a stove?"[lr]::
2534::$$$message_0015_0022_0002$$$::"Yeah. You burn charcoal inside, then cover it with a grill and cook on that. I don't own any charcoal, though."::
2535::$$$message_0015_0023_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ06d(遠) textoff=0]She was probably thinking we could grill some squid on it.[lr]::
2536::$$$message_0015_0023_0001$$$::Well...it isn't broken so we could use it any time. And it's fall right now. Pacific saury might be a better idea than squid.::
2537::$$$message_0015_0024_0000$$$::"Hmm... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06g(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ06g(遠) textoff=0]Woooow, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ04a(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ04a(遠) textoff=0]there's so much stuff here."::
2538::$$$message_0015_0025_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から storage=イリヤ04a(遠) textoff=0]Illya puts down the shichirin [se storage=se422.wav]and resumes exploring the shed.[lr]::
2539::$$$message_0015_0025_0001$$$::...A hot water bottle, the heater portion of a kotatsu, [se storage=se300.wav]a vacuum cleaner nozzle... Even I'm impressed at the sheer variety of random junk.::
2540::$$$message_0015_0026_0000$$$::"Do you fix and use everything here?"[lr]::
2541::$$$message_0015_0026_0001$$$::"Not necessarily...but I want to try to repurpose as much as possible."[lr]::
2542::$$$message_0015_0026_0002$$$::"Whew... Still, though."::
2543::$$$message_0015_0027_0000$$$::"So this is your workshop... Hmm."[lr]::
2544::$$$message_0015_0027_0001$$$::Illya walks around, examining everything.[lr]::
2545::$$$message_0015_0027_0002$$$::Complicated emotions flash across her face; at times she seems dissatisfied, other times she looks as if she wants to complain, but then becomes emotional.::
2546::$$$message_0015_0028_0000$$$::"What's this feeling... It isn't like her at all, but at the same time, it's really similar... Could it be..."[lr]::
2547::$$$message_0015_0028_0001$$$::"Illya...? Did you find something odd?"[lr]::
2548::$$$message_0015_0028_0002$$$::"...I don't know.[lr]::
2549::$$$message_0015_0028_0003$$$::Hey Shirou, what happened here? Did some big magecraft take place here?"::
2550::$$$message_0015_0029_0000$$$::"...? I practice Strengthening here, but I've never done anything big.[lr]::
2551::$$$message_0015_0029_0001$$$::If I had to say... Oh right, I think this is where Saber first showed up."::
2552::$$$message_0015_0030_0000$$$::"So you summoned Saber here.[lr]::
2553::$$$message_0015_0030_0001$$$::...That makes sense. You would be able to summon her here. Either the shed was built on top of a summoning circle, or it was placed here away from prying eyes. Only the previous summoner would know for sure, though."[lr]::
2554::$$$message_0015_0030_0002$$$::"...?"[lr]::
2555::$$$message_0015_0030_0003$$$::Illya sighs and mumbles in a quiet voice.::
2556::$$$message_0015_0031_0000$$$::"Well, it happened a long time ago. It doesn't matter now.[lr]::
2557::$$$message_0015_0031_0001$$$::As for your grade... I'll give it a 10 out of 100.[lr]::
2558::$$$message_0015_0031_0002$$$::It's an interesting place, but you need to build up your workshop properly. Right now it's just a storage room."[lr]::
2559::$$$message_0015_0031_0003$$$::"Ugh, I know... It's just an old habit, but I think I've always thought training room and storage just go together."::
2560::$$$message_0015_0032_0000$$$::"Haah, that sounds like you, Shirou... Maybe I'll give you a hand."[lr]::
2561::$$$message_0015_0032_0001$$$::"...Wait, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(遠) textoff=0]you mean to renovate it?"::
2562::$$$message_0015_0033_0000$$$::"Yeah. We'll have to move a lot of stuff around, but I can at least make it like my bedroom."[lr]::
2563::$$$message_0015_0033_0001$$$::Illya sounds confident.[lr]::
2564::$$$message_0015_0033_0002$$$::But her bedroom would mean...[lr]::
2565::$$$message_0015_0033_0003$$$::Um, that bedroom?::
2566::$$$message_0015_0034_0000$$$::"I'll call Sella and Leys here to clean the place up and refurnish it. Yeah, it should take about three days..."[lr]::
2567::$$$message_0015_0034_0001$$$::"Hold on. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ07a(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07a(遠) textoff=0]If we make this place look like your castle, I won't be able to relax."::
2568::$$$message_0015_0035_0000$$$::It would be surreal to have the inside of this shed become all European, in the middle of a traditional Japanese mansion.[lr]::
2569::$$$message_0015_0035_0001$$$::Imagine opening the shed door and being greeted with carpeting...::
2570::$$$message_0015_0036_0000$$$::"I'll take that into account, of course. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ10b(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ10b(遠) textoff=0]But first!"[lr]::
2571::$$$message_0015_0036_0001$$$::"Yes, ma'am."[lr]::
2572::$$$message_0015_0036_0002$$$::I reflexively bob my head at her lecturing tone.::
2573::$$$message_0015_0037_0000$$$::"If you want to be a full-fledged mage, then you need to organize your own environment. Building a workshop is a fundamental step of being a mage."[lr]::
2574::$$$message_0015_0037_0001$$$::"I'm very sorry, I'll take that to heart..."::
2575::$$$message_0015_0038_0000$$$::"What has Rin been teaching you? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ07d(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07d(遠) textoff=0]Honestly, I'm not sure if Tohsaka respects your autonomy too much, or if she's just going hands-off."[lr]::
2576::$$$message_0015_0038_0001$$$::Illya is unhappy with what she sees as Tohsaka's negligence. It's true that she's my current mentor, but...::
2577::$$$message_0015_0039_0000$$$::"No, I don't think that has anything [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01a(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01a(遠) textoff=0]to do with..."[lr]::
2578::$$$message_0015_0039_0001$$$::"Of course it does. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ10b(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ10b(遠) textoff=0]If the master doesn't monitor the way her apprentice builds his workshop, how is she going to know if he goes down the wrong path? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ02a(遠),イリヤ02b(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg storage=イリヤ02a(遠) time=400 textoff=0][wvl canskip=false time=800][chgfg storage=イリヤ02b(遠) time=400 textoff=0]Hmm?"[lr]::
2579::$$$message_0015_0039_0002$$$::...I have a strange hunch about all this.::
2580::$$$message_0015_0040_0000$$$::"Yeah, I'll have to keep an eye on you.[lr]::
2581::$$$message_0015_0040_0001$$$::I can't leave my big brother to the likes of Rin."::
2582::$$$message_0015_0041_0000$$$::[noise opacity=130]She's wearing a broad, smug, impish grin[stopnoise].[lr]::
2583::$$$message_0015_0041_0001$$$::[noise opacity=200]Her red eyes [stopnoise]start creeping toward me.[lr]::
2584::$$$message_0015_0041_0002$$$::[noise opacity=80]...A strong, musky scent [stopnoise]fills the dark shed...::
2585::$$$message_0015_0042_0000$$$::Steadily, a mirage begins to infiltrate my brain.[lr]::
2586::$$$message_0015_0042_0001$$$::...I'm like a moth drawn to flame.[lr]::
2587::$$$message_0015_0042_0002$$$::I could move whatever part of my body I want, [noise opacity=128]but I feel tense, like lifting even a finger will cause something big to fall apart...[stopnoise]::
2588::$$$message_0015_0043_0000$$$::"Heheh... Hey, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 opacity=60 storage=イリヤ06b(近) textoff=0]Shi[wvl][noise opacity=150]rou?[lr]::
2589::$$$message_0015_0043_0001$$$::I'll [wvl][stopnoise]make sure [wvl][noise opacity=255]to raise you so you grow up right.[wvl][stopnoise]"[lr]::
2590::$$$message_0015_0043_0002$$$::"Wait... Illya, calm down, you're..."[lr]::
2591::$$$message_0015_0043_0003$$$::"You're the one [wvl][noise opacity=200]who needs to calm down and think, Big Brother.[wvl][stopnoise][lr]::
2592::$$$message_0015_0043_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 opacity=60 storage=イリヤ11a(近) textoff=0]Look..."::
2593::$$$message_0015_0044_0000$$$::Illya's eyes [noise opacity=200]and lips drift closer[wait canskip=false time=400]...[stopnoise][lr]::
2594::$$$message_0015_0044_0001$$$::She's sitting on my lap, feeling as light as a feather.[wshock canskip=0]::
2595::$$$message_0015_0045_0000$$$::"Shirou... Big Brother, do you dislike me?"[lr]::
2596::$$$message_0015_0045_0001$$$::"No, I just..."[lr]::
2597::$$$message_0015_0045_0002$$$::"[noise opacity=100]If you like me, then I'll make you into one of my precious things.[lr]::
2598::$$$message_0015_0045_0003$$$::I'll turn you into the ultimate dessert, and you won't have to think about Saber or anyone else anymore..."[stopnoise]::
2599::$$$message_0015_0046_0000$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
2600::$$$message_0015_0046_0001$$$::...Suddenly, the fog lifts from my mind.[lr]::
2601::$$$message_0015_0046_0002$$$::Maybe I'm stronger the second time, but the experience of my first failure turns the tables.::
2602::$$$message_0015_0047_0000$$$::"...Heh. You're soft, Illya. The same trick won't work on me again."[lr]::
2603::$$$message_0015_0047_0001$$$::"Hey, Shirou... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08e(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=200 storage=イリヤ08e(近)]Wait, what?"[lr]::
2604::$$$message_0015_0047_0002$$$::I regain the freedom bound by those crimson eyes.::
2605::$$$message_0015_0048_0000$$$::"Now it's my turn to ask you. If you like me, will you become mine?"[lr]::
2606::$$$message_0015_0048_0001$$$::"E-ehhh!?"[lr]::
2607::$$$message_0015_0048_0002$$$::"...Got you, you're wide open!"[lr]::
2608::$$$message_0015_0048_0003$$$::I pick up Illya in my arms.::
2609::$$$message_0015_0049_0000$$$::"W-w-w-what are you doing, Shirou, you dummy!"[stopquake][lr]::
2610::$$$message_0015_0049_0001$$$::"I'm teaching a naughty girl a lesson for playing with other people like a cat does."[lr]::
2611::$$$message_0015_0049_0002$$$::"I-I'm not naughty, and I'm not a cat![lr]::
2612::$$$message_0015_0049_0003$$$::G-get your hands off me, I'm a lady!"::
2613::$$$message_0015_0050_0000$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ09a(近) textoff=0]She pounds her little fists in my back, [chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ03a(近)b textoff=0]but I don't care.[lr]::
2614::$$$message_0015_0050_0001$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ10b(近) textoff=0]I almost fell for that, [chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ09b(近) textoff=0]but this reminds me that Illya really is just a child.::
2615::$$$message_0015_0051_0000$$$::"Yeah, try again in ten years."[lr]::
2616::$$$message_0015_0051_0001$$$::"That's too long! In fact, after ten years you'll want to become mine so badly you can't stand it!"[lr]::
2617::$$$message_0015_0051_0002$$$::"Haha. Yeah, I might be in trouble if you try this again ten years from now."::
2618::$$$message_0015_0052_0000$$$::"Just you watch, Shirou! I'll be all plump and bouncy so that Sakura can't even hold a candle to me, never mind Rin!"[lr]::
2619::$$$message_0015_0052_0001$$$::"...Hm. That would make me a little sad."[lr]::
2620::$$$message_0015_0052_0002$$$::I want Illya to remain a pure, innocent princess[line len=2][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ08g(近) textoff=0]wait, what the heck am I mumbling!?::
2621::$$$message_0015_0053_0000$$$::"Let me go! Put me down! Shirou, you dummy!"[stopquake][lr]::
2622::$$$message_0015_0053_0001$$$::"Hahaha, I appreciate the compliment. Okay, let's have tea. We have some dorayaki from Edomaeya, too."[lr]::
2623::$$$message_0015_0053_0002$$$::"Huh? Really? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ03a(近)b][wvl canskip=false time=800][chgfg storage=イリヤ03a(近)b time=200 textoff=0][quake vmax=10 hmax=20]...As if that would win me over! Shirou, you dumb dummy!"::
902609::$$$message_9015_0049_0000$$$::"W-w-w-what are you doing, Shirou, you dummy!"[r]::

